{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de021f342b56cd08a00afb71751c9fc08208bb41ffbb5eb470db0371df2b690b", "ja": "（先日撮影した歩のPVの、編集前映像が届いた。\nうん、いい感じに撮れているな……）", "zh": "（前几天拍摄的步的PV，剪辑前的影像送来了。\n嗯，拍得挺不错的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5e8fd1ef96a2386cf35dd046bfff554855d07d815d43d9b9cd9854adfed75811", "ja": "あ……えっと、{$P$}。\n今、ちょっといい？", "zh": "啊……那个，{$P$}。\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "59ba350cb0e7036cc6d3e143f373dec6f6dff21e8b0335f08a481e9af948e4f7", "ja": "お、ちょうどいいところに来たな、歩。PVの\n編集前映像が届いたけど、一緒にチェックするか？", "zh": "哦，来得正好，步。PV的\n剪辑前影像送到了，要一起看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "489c3027712b923579866313bd13abbb18eb862ab67a92042ff62dc05c3b42cc", "ja": "え、ホント！？　見る見る、チェックする！\n……じゃなくて、{$P$}！", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？我要看我要看，检查一下！  \n……不对，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "449a58abd0cee5fcc8a376e6ce19cdf3ab78927ab04fa0662eea71108b2f3a10", "ja": "その前に、アタシ……{$P$}に、\n謝らなくちゃいけないことがあって！", "zh": "在那之前，我……有件事必须向{$P$}道歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "afac1b3d95b6e7bbde64dc6ff602ce2c4a542fd7e7861dfcc04fc7303fdb689b", "ja": "謝らなくちゃいけない事……何かあったか？", "zh": "需要道歉的事……发生什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "79b6686ae56e1a09c1acb502dee7bfc83e54bf82319f4c980963a6daf27b4149", "ja": "えっと、この前のお花見の時のことなんだけど。\n……あの時は、変なもの食べさせちゃってごめん！", "zh": "那个……是关于上次赏花时的事。\n……那时候让你吃了奇怪的东西，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4353656f48c6d9d905f6565f3039b90c33f8066321ff271552e4697a6edb34df", "ja": "変なものって……あ、もしかしてあの\n桜のハンバーガーの事か？", "zh": "奇怪的东西是指……啊，难道是说\n那个樱花汉堡的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d8f4d247d4a3c35e5405e608932116f2cb3e216371e894f94872fed459613c77", "ja": "そう、それ！　アタシ、最後のトッピング……って、\nワサビをたっぷりかけちゃったじゃん？", "zh": "对，就是那个！我不是把最后的配料……呃，芥末放得满满的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2ff14c11fc466cb1442c92fa2d59ffa902e5e40bdbebc939cfcf2f259d66172d", "ja": "アタシ、自分がワサビ好きだからさ。\nついクセで、たっぷりかけちゃったんだけど……。", "zh": "因为我自己喜欢芥末嘛。\n一不小心就习惯性地放了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6854c6388c4b40cefcd425dd59d49952b1308720639bbdd7748bd13daa63249", "ja": "食べるのは{$P$}なんだから、少しで\nよかったんだよね。悪いコトしちゃったかなって……。", "zh": "毕竟吃的人是{$P$}，少放一点就好了。感觉自己做了坏事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4ec1e4955a11a34de9df2b7b483a9145da3f7d812bc6292ccf2dc40b96893192", "ja": "その事か。確かに涙は出たけど、ワサビの\nアクセントがきいてて、ちゃんと美味しかったよ。", "zh": "是那件事啊。确实是辣得流泪了，不过芥末的点缀恰到好处，真的很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69b5f5d8ae6d3d302e4375fbe90302f5da5b98b5a315ceb23ff1f72959aad336", "ja": "ほ、ホント？　……{$P$}、\nアタシのワサビバーガー、ホントにおいしかった？", "zh": "真、真的？……{$P$}，我的芥末汉堡真的好吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ec02ca2ba1043851d23b3cc6dc58063ea3e880fe69d57bf33743aad9f8a037d2", "ja": "ああ、本当に美味しかった！\nだから心配しなくても大丈夫だ。", "zh": "啊，真的很好吃！\n所以不用担心，没事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a77b6801c46d92f7a85bb89a56288ce5f34a75bc1703bad2dbc6607fa065382b", "ja": "よかった～！　アタシ、料理はそんなに\n得意じゃないから、心配だったんだよね。", "zh": "太好了～！我做饭其实\n没那么拿手，之前还挺担心的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69b4d0a7c45270b9e53bb3e759c0c8599857b0b85ad527ed6a9c17b1e30f478f", "ja": "せっかく桜に合わせて、うまくできたと思ったのに、\nワサビを入れすぎちゃうし……はぁ。", "zh": "难得配合樱花做得这么成功，我还以为挺不错的，结果芥末放太多了……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cd111d44ed30b9b0afb693ed65712c4ae51eb2a0ac362511bf508d89b84bb9d3", "ja": "そんなに気にしなくても……それに、お礼が\nしたいっていう歩の気持ちは、ちゃんと伝わったよ。", "zh": "不用那么在意……而且，步想要道谢的心意，我已经好好感受到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f5e86810e82d0492edab3c5bfc11f07dc565d8b040666f37f3435b248d28b35d", "ja": "{$P$}……うん、ありがと！\nへへ、なんか元気出たかも。", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，谢谢你！\n嘿嘿，感觉好像打起精神来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "21ba8885653a98b64731d8a31eaa2fa97d352bedbfc1a3ea8ed18d726d583a61", "ja": "PVの映像、届いたんでしょ？　一緒に見ようよ！\n最高にカッコイイPVになるといいな～。", "zh": "MV的影像送过来了吧？我们一起看吧！\n要是能成为一部超帅气的MV就好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2e5d6c123af7afbde32d28661b1773b49ea63b058d136f43cdef814d7d40f3b3", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n歩の意見を聞かせてくれ！", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n说说你的意见吧，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a486fa740619cc7ac5ddf4a87aa26a6aafd53efaee68f9fa4c0c6120fb64bd14", "ja": "（その後、歩と映像をチェックした。\nいいPVになりそうだ……）", "zh": "（之后，我和步一起查看了影像。看来会拍成一支很棒的PV……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0163_1021_p", "source_sha256": "63213acec0d8e12bcfa8df75695b8900d6cf3fa30a3a90515a30a46c0e7cd4a2", "ja": "（歩の根本には誰かを喜ばせたいという気持ちがある。\n真っ直ぐに届くよう、手助けしていかないとな！）", "zh": "（步的内心深处，有着想让别人开心的心情。\n我得帮她一把，让这份心意能够直达大家心中才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
